<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main>
    <section class="page-header page-header-compact">
      <div class="container fade-up">
        <span class="eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-robot"></i> Asisten Toko</span>
        <h1>Tanya AI</h1>
        <p>Tanya jam buka, ongkir, cara bayar, atau ketersediaan stok.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section chat-section">
      <div class="container chat-container fade-up">
        <div class="chat-window">
          <div class="chat-header">
            <div class="chat-avatar ai-avatar"><i class="bi bi-robot"></i></div>
            <div>
              <h3>Asisten Ariesta</h3>
              <span class="chat-status"><span class="dot"></span> Online</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="chat-body" id="chatBody">
            <div class="chat-bubble bubble-ai">
              <div class="chat-avatar ai-avatar small"><i class="bi bi-robot"></i></div>
              <div class="bubble-content">
                Halo! 👋 Saya asisten Toko Sembako Ariesta. Ada yang bisa saya
                bantu soal stok, harga, ongkir, atau jam buka toko?
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <form class="chat-input-row" id="chatForm">
            <label for="chatInput" class="sr-only">Tulis pertanyaan Anda</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="chatInput"
              name="message"
              placeholder="Tulis pertanyaan Anda di sini..."
              autocomplete="off"
              required
            />
            <button type="submit" class="btn-send" aria-label="Kirim pertanyaan">
              <i class="bi bi-send-fill"></i>
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>

        <p class="chat-disclaimer">
          <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>
          Balasan asisten ini berupa simulasi logika sederhana (keyword
          matching) yang berjalan langsung di server toko kami — bukan API AI
          pihak ketiga.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
